1352 20F3             (benchmark_itoa64.):00371             BRA  IT64_ILOOP_3
1354                  (benchmark_itoa64.):00372         DONE_ILOOP_3:
1354 B610A2           (benchmark_itoa64.):00373             LDA  LEADZ          ; IF NOT IGNORING LEADING ZEROES,
1357 2712             (benchmark_itoa64.):00374             BEQ  ADDDIGIT_3     ; OUTPUT EVERY DIGIT.   
1359 B610A1           (benchmark_itoa64.):00375             LDA  DIGIT
